-- File: 07_generate_digital_data.sql
-- Project: CommBank Customer 360 (fictional prototype only)
-- Owner: Qiushi Huang
--
-- Load 186 digital customers, 1,000 activities, and 100 service cases.
-- Core number n maps to D || lpad(1000 + n). Example: C0001 -> D1001.
-- No digital profile for core numbers 3, 15, 30, 45, 60, 75, 90, 105, 120, 135, 150, 165, 180, 195.
-- service_case has no channel. Activity channel is MOBILE or WEB.
-- OPEN and IN_PROGRESS cases have a null closed_ts.
--
-- Platform: PostgreSQL 15 in the Lab Environment, database lab.
-- These scripts do not replace s1_core.customers, s2_payments.payers, or the
-- other tables already used by the warehouse run. They add the source-system
-- package beside that prototype.
--
-- Run order: 7 of 9. Next: 08_insert_edge_cases.sql.
-- =============================================================================

